		{
			description: [
				"The &eChat Box&r lets a computer read and write chat."
				""
				"&e&lWhat it is actually for:&r status reporting. A program that watches your power, your ore buffer or a reactor's temperature and says something in chat when it matters - so you find out before the base stops."
				""
				"&7Pair it with a Player Detector to have it greet or warn only when someone is present.&r"
			]
			icon: "advancedperipherals:chat_box"
			id: "38FC9026999746D9"
			rewards: [{
