			}]
			title: "&bInventory Manager"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The &ePlayer Detector&r finds players in range; the &eEnergy Detector&r measures FE passing through it; the &eEnvironment Detector&r reads biome, weather, time and light."
				""
				"&e&lThese are the sensor layer.&r Without them a computer knows nothing about the world. With them you can build a base that reacts - doors that open for you, generators that spin up when storage drops, lights on a day cycle."
				""
				"&7The Energy Detector is the one you will use most: put it inline on a cable and a script can graph your actual throughput.&r"
			]
			icon: "advancedperipherals:player_detector"
			id: "5555D212FA58CEFF"
			rewards: [{
