		{
			description: [
				"The &eGeo Scanner&r returns every block in a radius as data a script can process."
				""
				"&e&lUseless at home, excellent off-world.&r Your island is hollow. The Moon, Mars, Venus, Glacio and the Aether all have real terrain worth scanning before you commit a Digital Miner."
				""
				"&7It has a cooldown that scales with radius, so scripts should scan coarsely first and refine.&r"
			]
