		{
			description: [
				"The &eChunk Controller&r force-loads its chunk under script control."
				""
				"&e&lThe point is that it can be switched off.&r A script that loads a chunk only while a craft is running, then releases it, gives you the benefit of chunk loading without permanently ticking the chunk."
				""
				"&c&lThat matters on this server&r, where the standing rule is nothing that slows the machine down. Conditional loading is strictly better than blanket claims.&r"
			]
			icon: "advancedperipherals:chunk_controller"
			id: "1294F6D9AFB35C89"
			rewards: [{
				id: "02BA2B5E9EF7C1A8"
