		{
			description: [
				"&b&lYour base runs itself now.&r"
				""
				"An ME Bridge that requests crafts when stock drops. Detectors that notice things. An Inventory Manager that equips you. A Chat Box you can talk to. And chunk loading that switches itself off when idle."
				""
				"&7Everything here needed a trip to Mars first. That was the point.&r"
			]
